<title>CYPRUS: Rate on Cyprus 91-day bills at 5.68 pct at auction.</title>
<headline>Rate on Cyprus 91-day bills at 5.68 pct at auction.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bank of Cyprus on Wednesday sold 20.1 million pounds ($42.9 million) of 91-day treasury bills with a coupon of 5.68 percent from 5.87 percent at the last auction on December 31.</p>
<p>A Central Bank statement said it received competitive and non competitive bids for bills totalling 32.2 million pounds. ($=0.47 pounds).</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
